# FAST API is a web framework of python. Like Django, Flask, etc.

# FAST API vs OTHERS:
1. It is faster than all other frameworks and also supports microservices.
2. It is build on top of the Pydantic, so it automatically provides the data validation and data parcing functionality.
3. It supports asynchronous programming means can handle multiple requests simultaniously.

